  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"4 x minus 9 y equals 9 y plus 5\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>4</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>9</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>y</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>9</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>y</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mn>5</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"h y equals 2 plus 4 x\"><mi>h</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mi>x</mi></math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">In the given system of equations, <math alttext=\"h\"><mi>h</mi>\n</math> is a constant. If the system has no solution, what is the value of <math alttext=\"h\"><mi>h</mi>\n</math>?</p>",
